[PAYHIP MARKET INTEL]
2025's bestsellers solve 'execution paralysis'—creators know WHAT to do but not HOW to do it fast/beautifully/affordably. Products at $17-$49 price point with 5-15 minute implementation time, bundled assets (50+ templates = psychology win), and creator testimonials (not influencer endorsements) convert best. Notion+Canva+AI prompt combos are the holy trinity. Templates > Courses. Speed > Depth. DIY-friendly > Learning-curve heavy.

