[INSTAGRAM MARKET INTEL]
In 2025, Instagram has bifurcated into two algorithms: 1) Authenticity-first (Reels, Stories, unfiltered content) that favors parasocial connection and human vulnerability; 2) Aesthetic curation (Carousels, grid posts) that serves inspiration/design intent. The viral sweet spot is *authentic education*—teaching something real with unpolished production. AI-generated or over-edited content faces 40-60% reach suppression. Micro-communities (10K-100K niche accounts) now outperform mega-creators in engagement velocity. The algorithm rewards consistency of *voice* over consistency of posting. Niche beats viral. Depth beats virality.

